    "title": "Notepad - Notes and Notebook",
    "description": "Notepad is a notetaking app for taking notes, creating to-do lists quickly, memos, and editing plain text. Stay on top of all your notes from the after call menu.\r\n\r\nThe Notepad app not only creates plain text notes but also notes with checklists. Make your life more organized with the free notebook app that lets you write notes, memo, and tasks with ease and clarity.\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Notepad - Notes and Notebook Features</b></h2>\r\n\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Notepad with auto-save and sync\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Create a large number of simple notes for different purposes, with no limits\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Create checklists. Make a grocery list, a wish list, or a to-do list with checkboxes\r\n\u270d\ufe0f\u00a0Call Features\u00a0that allow you to create notes and a checklist after a call\r\n\u270d\ufe0f\u00a0After call note menu\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Experience the old notepad\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Pinned note & checklist\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Export notes as PDF files\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Creating and editing text notes\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Automatic writing notes saving\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Create fast and easy notes with the free notes app\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Mark a checklist of notes when things get done\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Set notes reminders to get notified\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Delete notes or restore notes from trash\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Add notes and a to-do list to the Calendar</b></h2>\r\nThis note-taking app allows you to add notes, or tasks on the Calendar. Easy to view your Notes in the Calendar view.\r\n\r\nDo you need a simple and convenient way to take notes on your device? Try Notepad Free, the best notes app for writing, editing, and organizing your memos. Notes Free is more than just a writing note pads. You can also edit your notes and access them anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nNotepad is a small and fast notetaking app for making notes, memos, or just any plain text content. This notebook is a book or stack of paper pages app and used writing pad for purposes such as note-taking, journaling, work, school, personal or other writing!\r\n\r\nNotepad - Notes and Notebook is a simple text editor app and word processing tool. This digital notebook is a plaintext editor and does not support pictures. It is a text editor, a very simple word processor. The most common use for Notpad is to view or edit text files.\r\n\r\nNotebook Free lets you create notebooks for notes and memo. Notepad Free is the ultimate note-taking app for anyone who wants to be more productive and creative. Whether you need an old notepad, writing pad, notebook, quick reminder, or a note calendar, you can get everything in simple notepad.\r\n\r\nNote app is a note book that helps you store great notes, quickly and safely notes writer. Free download it today and see why millions of users love Notepad Free.",
